<title>UK: S&amp;N names Alistair Grant as chairman.</title>
<headline>S&amp;N names Alistair Grant as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish &amp; Newcastle Plc said it named Sir Alistair Grant as non-executive chairman with effect from February 1 next year.  </p>
<p>Grant, who has been a non-executive director of the group since 1994, earlier this year announced his decision to retire as chairman of British food retailer and wholesaler Argyll Group Plc.</p>
<p>S&amp;N also announced that Brian Stewart would take on the role of deputy chairman in addition to that of chief executive.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
